{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDI0L0ElMjBSYWRpY2FsJTIwQWN0JTIwUmVuZWUlMjBNb250Z29tZXJ5JTIwJTI4MjAyNCUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"A Radical Act Renee Montgomery","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/jplyOSUSpb4ZYWcZvEGifD2F3L9.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kNEVqNAnLWVgyv9AKtsK7eKF4bU.jpg","description":"\"A Radical Act: Renee Montgomery,\" is an inspirational feature documentary about Renee Montgomery, the first former WNBA player to be both a co-owner and executive of a WNBA team. Renee Montgomery is a two-time WNBA Champion, sports broadcaster, and activist who is currently co-owner and vice president of the Atlanta Dream. This new feature documentary is an intimate portrait of Renee and the experiences that formed her character, from growing up in West Virginia to winning a national title at the University of Connecticut, then going on to capture two WNBA titles with the Minnesota Lynx. The documentary follows Renee's transition from player to front office and reflects how family and community helped turn Renee's integrity into a game changer.\n\nRated NR · Released 16 Oct 2024 · US · Language: English · 104 min\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2024","genres":["Documentary","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"4.0","runtime":"104 min","cast":["Renee Montgomery","Sirena Grace","Suzanne Abair"],"director":["Sandrine Orabona"],"released":"2024-10-16T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Sandrine Orabona","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jLDNr6zrl12opDCtezkUxsmttis.jpg"},{"name":"Renee Montgomery","character":"Herself"},{"name":"Sirena Grace","character":"Herself","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/apsIxDzC25185HlKpgOEduUQkq8.jpg"},{"name":"Suzanne Abair","character":"Herself"}]},"country":"US","language":"English","links":[{"name":"Renee Montgomery","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Renee%20Montgomery"},{"name":"Sirena Gr